Umbhalo xa-kufika: ['html'] yenza: { <- (
		ngokwakho
		buyisela: ['&'] nge: ['&amp;'],
		buyisela: ['<'] nge: ['&lt;'],
		buyisela: ['>'] nge: ['&gt;'],
		buyisela: ['"'] nge: ['&quot;']
	).
}.

>> list := Uluhlu entsha.

['Verbatim Syntax'] oonobumba nganye: { :inani :letter
	list ; ((['<li>#Number:Letter</li>']) Number: (inani), Letter: letter).
}.

Imveliso list.





>> template := ['
<html>
<body>
<p>Hello this is a test!</p>
<p>The string \‘Verbatim Syntax\’ has: 15 code points...</p>
<ul>
[list]
</ul>
</body> 
</html>
'] [list]: (list dibanisa: ['↵']).

Imveliso bhala: template.

